    {
      "id": "cc87bd1b-546b-49dc-8ec8-db65570f8654",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Prototyping is incredibly important since it helps designers validate an idea."
    },
    {
      "id": "c1aea96d-553c-4188-81ab-fe89df4c4584",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Some studios will have technical game designers who’s whole job will be to prototype and validate ideas in engine. However, you do not need to know how to program in order to validate an idea. Prototyping can be done using simple, easy to use tools."
    },
    {
      "id": "894f1e94-dacd-48cf-b2b8-e583f3940977",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "First, have a think about the question you are trying to answer and the simplest version of the feature you could do that answers that question. Then select your tool from below!"
    },
    {
      "id": "df2080a9-4396-4cef-832c-46f312a81d46",
      "type": "subheader",
      "html": "💃🏿 Paper prototyping 💃🏿",
      "anchorId": "paper-prototyping"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd24f2e2-fc0e-4e55-ac4a-f94cc4e28b1c",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Difficulty: 🍃"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca71d223-e805-43ba-92d7-eab91b4dc4f3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "First of all consider if you even need a computer to test out an idea. Nine times out of ten you probably don’t!"
    },
    {
      "id": "dad7e6ba-8b5a-4f26-9915-2891cc7e6ee4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Here are some prototype ideas you could do that require no computers at all:"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0b43b54-f993-4c88-b083-7766c16a08bb",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dt1bQsZ68iw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Paper sketch</a>"
    },
    {
      "id": "caea3cfe-3dd5-4e66-9558-b05594aa93e0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Theatre or improv performance"
    },
    {
      "id": "83345e41-db57-4a57-a92e-d6710adc82e6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://twitter.com/moreelen/status/1249690924155916289\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Board or card game</a>"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d30cfdb-eba1-4fcd-8df4-342c843dbe95",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "DnD campaign"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc634ba8-8d3f-4bf9-839b-d266883e23d5",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Paper or physical model"
    },
